  unitName: Endbringer Pig-Bull (EU)
  unitId: 760154
  unitNumber: 7104
  description: "Endbringer Pig Bull has followed Coal Cauldron\u2019s rise in power.
    Brothers in arms, Coal Cauldron\u2019s control over the region is also Pig Bull\u2019s.
    Today, however, he\u2019s trying a less brutal approach. The gang\u2019s next
    objective: take Bloody Blink\u2019s fortress by storm. Pig Bull, unknown to the
    inhabitants, will pose as a punk surviving in the desert and will lead the attack
    from inside the fortress."
  summonDesc: Home Run!
  fusionDesc: "I\u2019m going to pin you down."
  evoDesc: "I\u2019m ready for the second half."
